e company provides online ordering; white-labeled websites and mobile applications; Aloha Next by Voyix; and consumer experience, loyalty and marketing. It also provides professional, field break-fix, restaurant managed, installation services, and connected service desk; and fixed and mobile point-of-sale and consumer display terminals, self-checkout hardware, kiosks, kitchen display systems, printers, cash drawers, keyboards, handheld scanners and payment terminals, and ordering kiosks. The company was formerly known as NCR Corporation and changed its name to NCR Voyix Corporation in October 2023. The company was incorporated in 1884 and is headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia."}}